---@field subnetId? string The full resource ID of a subnet in a virtual network to deploy the Redis cache in. Example format: /subscriptions/{subscriptionId}/resourceGroups/{resourceGroupName}/Microsoft.{Network|ClassicNetwork}/VirtualNetworks/vnet1/subnets/subnet1
---@field staticIP? string Static IP address. Optionally, may be specified when deploying a Redis cache inside an existing Azure Virtual Network; auto assigned by default.

